' Sprites 16x16: Jacque, Erin, Shot, BoomA, BoomB, CrushA, CrushB, SkitA, SkitB, GrindA, GrindB, GrindHurt, JacqueB, ErinB
data SpritePat bytes
  $38,$38,$10,$38,$7C,$BA,$BA,$3A,$2A,$2A,$28,$28,$6C,$00,$00,$00
  $00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00
